DUNGEONS AND UNDEAD (D&U) came from the idea of making a fun videogame to share time with friends, partners, family members, etc. I love playing with my nephews, sometimes videogames, and I started thinking on a videogame which could be fun for everyone, not too complex. D&U will be available initially for PC and Linux, in English, French and Spanish. Later, I will try to publish the videogame for Xbox and PS4. Please share this with your social network;

[url=https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/legendsofeternalia/dungeons-and-undead]https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/legendsofeternalia/dungeons-and-undead[/url]

See more about the videogame;
[previewyoutube=X6Lh2NMO_2U;full][/previewyoutube]

Play together in local Wifi, or connect through Steam Remote Play Together with people anywhere in the world. Your friends could connect using their PCs even if they dont own / pay for the videogame (assuming a good internet connection, it consumes quite a lot of data). Voice and text chat are included in Steam Play Together, so you can have fun with your friends / family.

Here is the Steam link to the videogame to be released in beta in October 15th;
[url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/1278580/Dungeons_and_Undead/]https://store.steampowered.com/app/1278580/Dungeons_and_Undead/[/url]

Please feel free to let me know your thoughts and ideas. 
Thanks!
